InheritParentConfig: trueChecks: >  -modernize-loop-convert,  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-goto,  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-non-const-global-variables,  -misc-use-anonymous-namespace,  -modernize-use-std-print,  -modernize-type-traitsCheckOptions:  - key: readability-function-cognitive-complexity.Threshold    value: 50  # Relaxed for tests